  designNotes: 'Gift, a poisoned one: you plant it in an empty enemy slot and it
    joins their side. Each Dusk it sabotages: 1 damage to every creature on its side,
    itself included, so it lasts three Dusks. It''s still your card: it comes back
    to your discard pile. They can get rid of it sooner by summoning over it.'
  artDescription: A suburban dad mowing his lawn in a polo shirt, an earpiece coiled
    behind his ear, while his shadow on the grass wears a trench coat and holds a
    sniper rifle.
